{"seq":1,"slug":"expand-contract","title":"Expand-Contract 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/patterns/expand-contract","wordCount":1020,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"expand-contract-模式\">Expand-Contract 模式</h1><p>2016 年 GitHub 工程团队在内部确立了一条规则：任何 schema 变更都必须拆分为至少两次独立的部署——先扩展（expand），等应用代码完全切换后再收缩（contract）。这条规则的本质是将「一次不可回滚的大变更」拆解为「多次各自可回滚的小步骤」。Expand-Contract 模式不是某个工具的功能，而是所有零停机迁移的<strong>底层哲学</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Expand-Contract 的核心洞察：<strong>schema 变更和代码变更必须解耦</strong>。直接执行 <code>RENAME COLUMN</code> 会在瞬间打断所有引用该列的应用代码；但如果先添加新列（expand）、让应用代码逐步迁移到新列、最后再删除旧列（contract），整个过程中系统始终保持可用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Phase1[阶段一: Expand]&#10;        A[添加新列 login_name] --&gt; B[新旧列并存]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Phase2[阶段二: Migrate]&#10;        B --&gt; C[双写: 写入两列]&#10;        C --&gt; D[回填历史数据]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Phase3[阶段三: Contract]&#10;        D --&gt; E[应用只读新列]&#10;        E --&gt; F[停止写旧列]&#10;        F --&gt; G[删除旧列 username]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Phase1[阶段一: Expand]\n        A[添加新列 login_name] --&gt; B[新旧列并存]\n    end\n    subgraph Phase2[阶段二: Migrate]\n        B --&gt; C[双写: 写入两列]\n        C --&gt; D[回填历史数据]\n    end\n    subgraph Phase3[阶段三: Contract]\n        D --&gt; E[应用只读新列]\n        E --&gt; F[停止写旧列]\n        F --&gt; G[删除旧列 username]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>数据库操作</th>\n<th>应用代码状态</th>\n<th>可回滚性</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Expand</td>\n<td>ADD COLUMN</td>\n<td>仍使用旧列</td>\n<td>直接 DROP 新列</td>\n<td>秒级部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dual-Write</td>\n<td>无 DDL</td>\n<td>同时写新旧列</td>\n<td>回滚到只写旧列</td>\n<td>天~周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backfill</td>\n<td>UPDATE batch</td>\n<td>双写中</td>\n<td>停止回填即可</td>\n<td>小时~天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Switch-Read</td>\n<td>无 DDL</td>\n<td>读新列为主</td>\n<td>切回读旧列</td>\n<td>天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Switch-Write</td>\n<td>无 DDL</td>\n<td>只写新列</td>\n<td>恢复双写</td>\n<td>天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Contract</td>\n<td>DROP COLUMN</td>\n<td>完全使用新列</td>\n<td><strong>不可逆</strong></td>\n<td>秒级部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"六步详解-列重命名\">六步详解：列重命名</h2><p>以将 <code>users.username</code> 重命名为 <code>users.login_name</code> 为例，展示完整的六步执行：</p>\n<p><strong>Step 1: Expand（安全的 schema 变更）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 迁移文件 V020__expand_add_login_name.sql&#10;ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN login_name VARCHAR(255);&#10;-- MySQL: Instant DDL, 毫秒完成&#10;-- PostgreSQL: 元数据操作, 毫秒完成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 迁移文件 V020__expand_add_login_name.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN login_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">255</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL: Instant DDL, 毫秒完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL: 元数据操作, 毫秒完成</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这步之后，数据库有两列：<code>username</code>（有数据）和 <code>login_name</code>（全 NULL）。旧代码完全不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Dual-Write（应用层变更，第一次部署）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 应用代码变更：写入时同时写两列&#10;def create_user(name):&#10;    db.execute(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        INSERT INTO users (username, login_name, ...)&#10;        VALUES (%s, %s, ...)&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;, (name, name, ...))&#10;&#10;def update_username(user_id, new_name):&#10;    db.execute(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        UPDATE users SET username = %s, login_name = %s&#10;        WHERE id = %s&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;, (new_name, new_name, user_id))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 应用代码变更：写入时同时写两列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        INSERT INTO users (username, login_name, ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        VALUES (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (name, name, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update_username</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_id, new_name):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        UPDATE users SET username = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, login_name = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE id = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (new_name, new_name, user_id))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Step 3: Backfill（填充历史数据）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 独立的数据迁移，分批执行避免锁争抢&#10;-- 迁移文件 V021__backfill_login_name.sql（或通过后台任务）&#10;UPDATE users&#10;SET login_name = username&#10;WHERE login_name IS NULL&#10;AND id BETWEEN ? AND ?;  -- 分批，每批 1000~10000 行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 独立的数据迁移，分批执行避免锁争抢</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 迁移文件 V021__backfill_login_name.sql（或通过后台任务）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> login_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> login_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分批，每批 1000~10000 行</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Step 4: Switch-Read（应用层变更，第二次部署）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 读取时优先使用新列&#10;def get_display_name(user_id):&#10;    row = db.query(&quot;SELECT login_name, username FROM users WHERE id = %s&quot;, user_id)&#10;    return row.login_name or row.username  # 防御性：回填可能未完成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 读取时优先使用新列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_display_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.query(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELECT login_name, username FROM users WHERE id = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row.login_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row.username  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 防御性：回填可能未完成</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Step 5: Switch-Write（应用层变更，第三次部署）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 确认 backfill 100% 完成后，停止写旧列&#10;def create_user(name):&#10;    db.execute(&quot;INSERT INTO users (login_name, ...) VALUES (%s, ...)&quot;, (name, ...))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 确认 backfill 100% 完成后，停止写旧列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INSERT INTO users (login_name, ...) VALUES (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, ...)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (name, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Step 6: Contract（不可逆的清理）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 迁移文件 V022__contract_drop_username.sql&#10;-- 在 Step 5 部署稳定运行数周后执行&#10;ALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN username;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 迁移文件 V022__contract_drop_username.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 在 Step 5 部署稳定运行数周后执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DROP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN username;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时间窗口与风险管理\">时间窗口与风险管理</h2><p>Expand-Contract 的关键设计决策是<strong>各阶段之间的等待时间</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title Expand-Contract 时间线(典型生产场景)&#10;    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD&#10;    section Schema&#10;    Expand (ADD COLUMN)        :done, e1, 2026-07-01, 1d&#10;    Contract (DROP COLUMN)     :crit, c1, 2026-07-28, 1d&#10;    section Application&#10;    Deploy dual-write          :active, d1, 2026-07-02, 2d&#10;    Backfill historical data   :d2, 2026-07-04, 3d&#10;    Deploy switch-read         :d3, 2026-07-08, 2d&#10;    Deploy switch-write        :d4, 2026-07-14, 2d&#10;    Monitoring window          :d5, 2026-07-16, 12d\">gantt\n    title Expand-Contract 时间线(典型生产场景)\n    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD\n    section Schema\n    Expand (ADD COLUMN)        :done, e1, 2026-07-01, 1d\n    Contract (DROP COLUMN)     :crit, c1, 2026-07-28, 1d\n    section Application\n    Deploy dual-write          :active, d1, 2026-07-02, 2d\n    Backfill historical data   :d2, 2026-07-04, 3d\n    Deploy switch-read         :d3, 2026-07-08, 2d\n    Deploy switch-write        :d4, 2026-07-14, 2d\n    Monitoring window          :d5, 2026-07-16, 12d</pre><p>核心原则：<strong>Expand 要快，Contract 要慢</strong>。Expand 阶段的 DDL 通常毫秒完成且完全可逆；Contract 阶段的 DROP 不可逆，必须在所有指标确认正常后才能执行。一般建议 Contract 比最后一次代码部署晚至少 2-4 周。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见变更场景的-expand-contract-应用\">常见变更场景的 Expand-Contract 应用</h2><p><strong>列类型变更</strong>（如 INT → BIGINT）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Expand: <code>ADD COLUMN id_new BIGINT</code></li>\n<li>Dual-write + backfill</li>\n<li>原子 swap（需要 shadow table 工具辅助，或改为应用层路由）</li>\n<li>Contract: <code>DROP COLUMN id</code>，<code>RENAME COLUMN id_new TO id</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>添加 NOT NULL 约束</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Expand: 加列时先不加 NOT NULL</li>\n<li>确保所有写入路径都填值</li>\n<li>Backfill 所有 NULL 行</li>\n<li>Contract: <code>ALTER TABLE ... ALTER COLUMN ... SET NOT NULL</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>拆表</strong>（normalization）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Expand: 创建新表 + 在旧表保留原列</li>\n<li>Dual-write: 写入时同时更新两张表</li>\n<li>Backfill: 将旧表数据拷贝到新表</li>\n<li>Switch-read: 查询切到新表</li>\n<li>Contract: 从旧表删除已拆出的列</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"与-feature-flag-的协同\">与 Feature Flag 的协同</h2><p>Expand-Contract 的多次代码部署天然适合与 Feature Flag 结合——每个阶段的代码切换可以通过 flag 控制，实现更精细的灰度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 使用 feature flag 控制读取路径&#10;if feature_flags.is_enabled(&quot;use_login_name&quot;, user_id):&#10;    return user.login_name&#10;else:&#10;    return user.username\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 feature flag 控制读取路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature_flags.is_enabled(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"use_login_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.login_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.username</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这允许按百分比逐步切换（1% → 10% → 50% → 100%），在每个百分比观察错误率和延迟，发现问题立即关闭 flag 回退。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式的局限与补充\">模式的局限与补充</h2><p>Expand-Contract 不是万能的。它的主要局限：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多次部署的协调成本</strong>：简单变更也需要 3-6 次独立部署，对小团队可能过重</li>\n<li><strong>双写期间的一致性</strong>：如果 dual-write 逻辑有 bug，两列数据可能不一致</li>\n<li><strong>不适合 atomic swap</strong>：当新旧列不能并存时（如主键变更），需要结合 shadow table 工具</li>\n<li><strong>数据库层面仍需索引等辅助</strong>：新列的索引仍需要在线构建（参见 gh-ost 章节）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Expand-Contract 的核心是将不可逆变更拆为多步可逆操作，每步独立部署</li>\n<li>六步流程：Expand → Dual-Write → Backfill → Switch-Read → Switch-Write → Contract</li>\n<li>Expand 要快（毫秒 DDL），Contract 要慢（观察 2-4 周后再删）</li>\n<li>与 Feature Flag 结合可实现百分比灰度切换</li>\n<li>适用于列重命名、类型变更、约束添加、表拆分等场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"shadow-table-swap\">Shadow Table Swap 机制</a>：当 expand-contract 需要原子切换整表时的工具级实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../microservices-architecture/microservices-patterns/saga-pattern\">微服务中的 Saga 模式</a>：跨服务数据一致性的编排模式，与 expand-contract 在分布式场景的结合</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Expand-Contract 模式","id":"expand-contract-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"六步详解：列重命名","id":"六步详解-列重命名"},{"level":2,"text":"时间窗口与风险管理","id":"时间窗口与风险管理"},{"level":2,"text":"常见变更场景的 Expand-Contract 应用","id":"常见变更场景的-expand-contract-应用"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Feature Flag 的协同","id":"与-feature-flag-的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"模式的局限与补充","id":"模式的局限与补充"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"锁机制与并发控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/foundations/locking-and-concurrency"},"next":{"title":"Shadow Table Swap 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/patterns/shadow-table-swap"}}